{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Every Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and unlock a huge roster of playable animals through gameplay. No microtransactions, no paywalls - just play to unlock them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Map Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features unique events that shake up the action. Lightning strikes, stampeding herds of rams, rogue lawnmowers, and food poisoning keep every round unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Party Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use map-specific weapons like mailboxes, rocks, and trash bags to sabotage your opponents and steal their snacks. When the round ends, race to the end of the screen for bonus points that could determine the winner!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy Controls for Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and customizable settings mean anyone can play, regardless of age or gaming experience. Perfect for family game nights and friend gatherings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887630?t=1762641202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887630/adc2c8ac7e0766a7825f17db9d955ddacd04181e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762641202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887630/4c87e82b8fec0a459024b5e9e9f3d42bd466dafb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762641202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887630/4c87e82b8fec0a459024b5e9e9f3d42bd466dafb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762641202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4092900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Every Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and unlock a huge roster of playable animals through gameplay. No microtransactions, no paywalls - just play to unlock them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Map Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features unique events that shake up the action. Lightning strikes, stampeding herds of rams, rogue lawnmowers, and food poisoning keep every round unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Party Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use map-specific weapons like mailboxes, rocks, and trash bags to sabotage your opponents and steal their snacks. When the round ends, race to the end of the screen for bonus points that could determine the winner!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy Controls for Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and customizable settings mean anyone can play, regardless of age or gaming experience. Perfect for family game nights and friend gatherings.</p>","developers":["Tyler Miller"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887630/a2b25c91957a484e7ec905fcf5e1b7b7346208ad/header.jpg?t=1762641202","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3887630/2037553935/1e6b8cacf1a929f042c6aa2a7bf50b90c49222ec/1753668508/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754423493","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3887630/2037553935/1e6b8cacf1a929f042c6aa2a7bf50b90c49222ec/1753668508/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754423493